        <h1>Polycool — Discover Top Wallets Across Prediction Markets</h1>
        <p>Polycool is the analytics and discovery app for prediction markets. Track top wallets, explore real-time activity, and uncover trends across thousands of markets. Non-custodial. Mobile-first.</p>
        <h2>Features</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/features/copy-trading">Wallet Tracking</a> — Follow high-performing wallet activity across prediction markets</li>
          <li><a href="/features/smart-feed">Smart Feed</a> — Real-time activity from verified high-performing wallets</li>
          <li><a href="/features/alerts">Activity Alerts</a> — Custom notifications on wallet activity that matters</li>
          <li><a href="/features/insiders">Insider Signals</a> — Surface large or unusual wallet movements as they happen</li>
          <li><a href="/features/news">Market News</a> — Stay informed on prediction-market trends and narratives</li>
          <li><a href="/features/auto-redeem">Resolution Tracking</a> — Follow market resolutions in real time</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Pricing</h2>
        <p>Free to download. 1% fee per trade. No subscription. No signup fee. <a href="/pricing">Learn more</a>.</p>
        <h2>Top Polymarket Trader Leaderboards</h2>
