        </ul>
        <h2>FAQ</h2>
        <dl>
          <dt>What is Polycool?</dt><dd>A discovery and analytics app for prediction markets, with wallet tracking, smart feeds, activity alerts, news, and resolution tracking.</dd>
          <dt>Is Polycool a market or an exchange?</dt><dd>No. Polycool is not a market, exchange, or broker. Markets, pricing, and order matching live on third-party prediction-market platforms — Polycool is the discovery, analytics, and wallet layer on top.</dd>
          <dt>Where do my funds sit?</dt><dd>Always in your own non-custodial wallet, secured by Privy. Polycool never holds, custodies, or has access to your funds.</dd>
          <dt>What happens when I act on something I discover?</dt><dd>Your own non-custodial wallet interacts directly with the underlying third-party prediction market. Polycool surfaces the opportunity and helps you act on it from your wallet — it does not run the market itself.</dd>
          <dt>How much does Polycool cost?</dt><dd>Free to download and use as a discovery and analytics app. A 1% fee applies on each trade you choose to make. Standard third-party market fees may also apply on the underlying prediction-market platforms.</dd>
        </dl>
